  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ea107d3d0fbef947af73792cc9f28a0, type: 3}
  m_Name: ThursdayIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueType: 0
  sentences:
  - Greetings once again.
  - I have returned to return my glorius Lubert. You of course know he speaks extraordinarily
    well, but I actually taught him a couple new words!
  - Anywho, I will be back Friday evening. I am a part of a major project, but I
    can't tell you because I signed a special NDA.
  - I just know you want me to tell you. So sorry! No details out of my mouth.
  - Toodaloo~
